{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/12960","id":5447933310,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABRLjdfg","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/12960","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/12960.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/12960.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/12960","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/12960/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/12960/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/12960/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/224e855e5fc9ff7df8ae118fdd5063a4ea6eb749","number":12960,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"id(currency): F5 PoC — gateway composition over registry, factory, envelope (#2321)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #2321.\n\nF5 PoC: composes the landed F1 registry (#2317), F2 account factory (#2318), and F3 gateway envelope (#2319) into one service (`pkgs/id/src/currency/gateway_poc.rs`) over the #2289 ledger seam, following the §4.3 pipeline: verify envelope → idempotency → resolve → authorize → build batch (factory accounts + one transfer whose `user_data_128` stamps the signed graph object) → submit once → signed receipt.\n\n- Register → record signed definition → issue → transfer over a single currency; the full flow runs against a local TigerBeetle cluster (pinned 0.17.9) in the ignored live test, and against the in-memory backend in unit tests.\n- Overdrafts are refused by the cluster (`debits_must_not_exceed_credits` on holder accounts), never by a gateway pre-check — the gateway submits without reading a balance.\n- The `history` flag is carried through the `currency_poc` ledger seam so F2's per-kind flags reach the cluster unchanged.\n- The module docs carry the 13-point write-up of every place the PoC guessed where the design was silent (also posted on #2321), including the replay finding: F3 `authorize` is not replay-aware, so replays short-circuit before authorization per §4.3's step order.\n\nVerification (laptop, `nix develop` in `pkgs/id`): gateway_poc unit tests 2/2; live TigerBeetle test 1/1; all 134 `currency*` lib tests pass; `id-currency-registry` suite 12/12; rustfmt clean; clippy exit 0 (warnings only, same classes as surrounding code).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://dashboardbackend.blacksmith.sh/track/run-proof?expires=1798005372&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=12960&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F12960&variant=run_proof&signature=8109b11762b2a35e2a3edd772b59f43b96298ef3b008524de1ea62b1913a71b9\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-run-proof-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-run-proof-v2-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Run Proof\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/proof-run-proof-v2-dark-3x.png\" width=\"102\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/12960?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":[{"id":13198400136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADEq-aiA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/audit:complete","name":"audit:complete","description":"PR fully implemented spawning issue","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-23T05:56:09Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T00:52:12Z","closed_at":"2026-11-23T05:56:21Z","merged_at":"2026-11-23T05:56:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"48f190e0b41553a885c7e0a8238b64d77c8f17ce","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"developing-today:lane-ew/2321-gateway-poc","ref":"lane-ew/2321-gateway-poc","repo":{"id":627308783,"node_id":"R_kgDOJWP47w","name":"code","full_name":"developing-today/code","owner":{"login":"developing-today","id":26439447,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjI2NDM5NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26439447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today/starre